{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06244","headline":"和王维敕赐百官樱桃 · 崔兴宗","name":"和王维敕赐百官樱桃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未央朝谒正逶迤，天上樱桃锡此时。\n朱实初传九华殿，繁花旧杂万年枝。\n未胜晏子江南橘，莫比潘家大谷梨。\n闻道令人好颜色，神农本草自应知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔兴宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}